"description":"MotoMainte is an app that helps you easily record and manage your motorcycle maintenance history.\n\n\"When was my last oil change?\"\n\"How many kilometers ago did I clean the chain?\"\n\"When is my next maintenance due?\"\n\nMotoMainte helps you keep track of your motorcycle maintenance.\n\nRecord not only the service date and odometer reading, but also expenses, notes, and photos. You can review your complete maintenance history and maintenance costs at any time.\n\nYou can also set maintenance intervals by mileage or days for each maintenance item, making it easy to know when your next service is due.\n\n**Main Features**\n\n**Vehicle Management**\n\n* Manage multiple motorcycles\n* Register vehicle photos\n* Track odometer readings\n* Store owner's manuals (Web / PDF)\n\n**Maintenance Management**\n\n* Oil changes\n* Chain cleaning\n* Tire replacement\n* Brake maintenance\n* Other maintenance records\n\n**Maintenance History**\n\n* Record service dates and mileage\n* Record expenses\n* Save notes\n* Attach photos\n* View maintenance history\n* Duplicate previous records to create new maintenance entries\n\n**Maintenance Schedule**\n\n* Manage by mileage or days\n* Check upcoming maintenance\n* View elapsed mileage and days since the previous service\n* Receive maintenance reminders\n\n**Customization**\n\n* Add, edit, and delete maintenance items\n* Customize icons and colors\n* Customize displayed information\n\nWhether you commute, ride on weekends, or enjoy touring, MotoMainte helps you keep your motorcycle maintenance organized.\n\n*Maintenance intervals vary depending on the manufacturer, model, and riding conditions. Please configure them appropriately for your vehicle.*", "bundleId":"jp.thirdware.MotoMainte", "currentVersionReleaseDate":"2026-07-19T21:46:10Z", "userRatingCount":6}]
